# Paths OpenWiki must not treat as source.
#
# The wiki is generated into `openwiki/`, a symlink to `documentation/openwiki/`.
# OpenWiki excludes `openwiki/` from its source fingerprint and changed-path
# list by that logical name, but git reports the real path. Without this entry
# every refresh would see its own output as a change to the repository and
# never settle on "nothing to update".
documentation/openwiki/
